#: project.cpp:6269
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"<title>Publish Your Provider Plugin</title><para>Please make sure your "
"plugin is working and run all tests with it before publishing your plugin.</"
"para><para>The first preview image should be a map showing supported "
"regions. The second preview should have been generated automatically and "
