"need to install the provider and make it ready (eg. import the GTFS feed) "
"for the preview image to be generated correctly.</warning></para>"
msgstr ""
"<title>Objavite Vaš dodatak pružatelja usluga</title><para>Molimo provjerite "
"da Vaš dodatak radi i obavite sve testove prije objavljivanja Vašeg dodatka."
