msgid ""
"You should provide a short version of the URL to the home page of the "
"service provider"
msgstr ""
"Trebali biste navesti kratku verziju URL početne stranice servisa pružatelja "
"usluga"

#: serviceproviderdatatester.cpp:353
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"<title>You should provide a short version of the URL to the home page of the "
"service provider</title> <para>Applets may want to show the short URL as "
"display text for the home page link, to save space. The result would be that "
"nothing is shown. Open the project settings to add a <interface>Short URL</"
"interface>.</para>"
msgstr ""
"<title>Trebali biste navesti kratku verziju URL početne stranice servisa "
"pružatelja usluga</title> <para>Appleti će možda htjeti da pokažu  kratki "
"URL kao tekst na zaslonu za poveznicu za početnu stranicu da uštede na "
"prostoru. Rezultat bi bio da ništa nije bilo prikazano. Otvorite podešavanja "
"projekta da dodate <interface>kratki URL</interface>.</para>"

