#: timetablemate.cpp:1783
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"<title>Create New Provider Plugin</title><para>To create a new provider "
"plugin first choose the type of the plugin. Currently <emphasize>Scripted</"
"emphasize> and <emphasize>GTFS</emphasize> (since version 0.11) types are "
"available. Your version of TimetableMate may be compiled without support for "
"one of these types.</para><para>The <emphasize>Scripted</emphasize> type can "
"be used for a variety of providers publishing their timetable data in web "
"sites. Helper functions are provided to easily parse HTML sites for "
"timetable data in the script (QtScript, ie. JavaScript, by using the Kross "
"script extension Python and Ruby are also available). The script extension "
"\"qt.xml\" helps parsing XML data sources. For providers using the HAFAS API "
"there is a base script available, use <icode>include( \"base_hafas.js\" );</"
"icode></para><para>If a <emphasize>GTFS</emphasize> feed is available a "
"provider plugin can be created much easier, ie. without writing a script. "
"Only the URL to the GTFS feed is needed. <emphasize>GTFS-realtime</"
"emphasize> TripUpdates and Alerts URLs can also be specified.</para>"
msgstr ""
"<title>Kreiraj novi dodatak pružatelja usluga</title><para>Da bi ste "
"kreirali novi dodatak pružatelja usluga prvo odaberite tip dodatka. Trenutno "
"<emphasize>Scripted</emphasize> i <emphasize>GTFS</emphasize> (od verzije "
"0.11) tipovi su dostupni. Vaša verzija PlanerPrijatelja može biti "
"kompajlirana bez podrške za jedan od ovih tipova.</para><para> "
"<emphasize>Skriptirani</emphasize> može biti korišten za veliki broj "
"pružatelja usluga koji objavljuje svoje podatke za planere na web "
"stranicama. Pomoćne funkcije su omogućene da jednostavno analiziraju HTML "
"stranice za podatke planera u komandnoj datoteci (QtScript, ie. JavaScript, "
"koristeći Kross komandnu datoteku sa ekstenzijama piton i rubin crvenasu "
"također dostupne). Ekstenzija komandne datoteke \"qt.xml\" pomaže "
"analizirati XML izvore podataka. Za pružatele usluga koji koriste HAFAS API "
"dostupna je bazna komandna datoteka, upotreba <icode>uključuje( \"base_hafas."
"js\" );</icode></para><para>Ako <emphasize>GTFS</emphasize> je unos dostupan "
"dodatak pružatela usluga može biti kreiran mnogo jednostavnije, npr. bez "
"pisanja komandne datoteke. Jedino URL za GTFS unos je potreban. "
"<emphasize>GTFS-realtime</emphasize> TripUpdates and Alerts URLs can also be "
"specified.</para>"

